{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"Mictlan rouses with a faint frown as they dust down their rumpled and lightly singed feathers. \"This is. Inconvenient.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:29:53.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865450143598903347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"Jigsaw bristles and they let out a snicker. \"Sir? The elf calls me sir... quite funny.\" They say to themselves. They drop into a whisper that sounds like a hiss \"We can get your coat on our way out of here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:30:34.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865450314907648011","reply_to_id":"865449614840561675","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
