{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"Are we leaving?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:32:27.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865450788909744168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"I have. A limited assortment. Of abilities. That can help. In this scenario.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:33:21.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865451014245187605","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"That seems to give me pause. \"I suppose I do as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:34:36.473000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865451330390589460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"I would be. Much more useful. With my book.\" Mictlan looks down to their hands mournfully and produces a quill.","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:35:35.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865451578064502794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"Jigsaw nods \"I can't do much without my armor but...\" they look around the cell, \"they didn't get all of us. Surely the other patriots are on their way. What those dirty coats did was awful, they won't let it stand\" they have dropped their voice to a whisper so the guards don't overhear.","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:38:07.551000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865452215715758110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"I. Agree. Yet. Surely there must be something, we can do to prepare for their arrival.\" I look at my cellmates with a rueful expression. \"Though. I must be careful, about my magic . . . the last time I used it someone got hurt.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:40:01.079000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865452691886964776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"I can. Create armor. Kind of. Through. Magic,\" Mictlan shrugs, fiddling with a sleeve of their robes. \"If anyone has some cured leather. \"Oh. What can you do. With your magic.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:40:21.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865452775901757440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"A sneering mixture of pride and glee crosses my face. \"I make loud noises. They break things! I can change my form a little, or do tricks!\" I conjure a gust of wind to ruffle everyone's clothes.","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:42:54.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865453420806406174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"\"I can. Mess with. People's heads.\" With the many eyes and wings and such going around for Mictlan, they look pretty much good at that. \"Oh. I also have. This.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:44:19.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865453775120236564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
