{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863652354171863070","content":"Jigsaw doesn't stop looking at the many eyed eldritch ball until it is dispersed. \"Very interesting. I would love to try to recreate something like that out of metal...\" they sit in thought for a moment. \"But I can't do much without my tools. An armorer without armor is... just an er?\" they shake their head \"sometimes... I can cause things to happen if I hit something and get very lucky... but it's only happened once before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:50:55.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865455435280941129","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
